Pusula model weights are LoRA adapters and a code readout trained on top of vllm-sr/d3 (Pusula)
and a fine-tuned TabiBERT cross-encoder (Pusula Nano).

Data provenance. Pusula models were trained primarily on synthetic Turkish data generated for this
project. A limited set of real customer messages, licensed from a commercial partner, was also
included in the training data. These messages were anonymized prior to use and are not redistributed
in any form.
